i\"\r\n    content   String\r\n    hintLevel Int          @default(0)\r\n    flagged   Boolean      @default(false)\r\n    rating    Int? // 1 = �Y'?, -1 = �Y'Z\r\n    createdAt DateTime     @default(now())\r\n  \r\n    @@index([childId, missionId, createdAt])\r\n  }\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\n\nLog: file:///C:/Users/Hawi/.gemini/antigravity/brain/3bb14083-d6a0-411e-b604-f883323ac764/.system_generated/tasks/task-177.log\n</SYSTEM_MESSAGE>"}
